Upgrade Notes
-------------
1. Hide libraries from DPorts:

   mv /usr/local/include /usr/local/include.hide
   mv /usr/local/libdata/pkgconfig /usr/local/libdata/pkgconfig.hide

2. Expose base private libraries:

   ln -s priv/openssl /usr/include/openssl
   ln -s libprivate_ssl.so /usr/lib/priv/libssl.so
   ln -s libprivate_crypto.so /usr/lib/priv/libcrypto.so
   ln -s libprivate_edit.so /usr/lib/priv/libedit.so
   ln -s libprivate_ncurses.so /usr/lib/priv/libcurses.so
   ln -s libprivate_ldns.so /usr/lib/priv/libldns.so

3. Configure the source:

   ./configure --prefix=/usr --sysconfdir=/etc/ssh \
       --with-sandbox=rlimit \
       --with-privsep-path=/var/empty \
       --with-xauth="/usr/local/bin/xauth" \
       --with-pam \
       --with-libedit \
       --with-ldns \
       --without-rpath \
       --without-ssl-engine \
       CFLAGS="-I/usr/include/priv" \
       LDFLAGS="-L/usr/lib/priv"

4. Copy the generated config.h:

   cp config.h /usr/src/lib/libssh/config.h.auto

5. Check the config.h corrections in lib/libssh/Makefile and update
   if necessary.

6. Restore the libraries changes:

   mv /usr/local/include.hide /usr/local/include
   mv /usr/local/libdata/pkgconfig.hide /usr/local/libdata/pkgconfig
   rm /usr/include/openssl \
       /usr/lib/priv/libssl.so \
       /usr/lib/priv/libcrypto.so \
       /usr/lib/priv/libedit.so \
       /usr/lib/priv/libcurses.so \
       /usr/lib/priv/libldns.so

7. Update the makefiles of all components, test building and installation,
   fix issues, and test the final programs.
